(CSV IMPORT AND EXPORT GUIDE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(These CSV files are designed for Google Sheets, Excel, Numbers, and browser-local workflows.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Rules) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Keep the first row as the header row.) Tj
T*
(- Do not rename headers.) Tj
T*
(- Add custom fields only after the standard columns.) Tj
T*
(- Use UTF-8 CSV.) Tj
T*
(- Use YYYY-MM-DD for dates.) Tj
T*
(- Use semicolons inside cells when listing multiple regions or data categories.) Tj
T*
(- Avoid formulas in shared CSV files.) Tj
T*
(- Keep status values consistent so filtering works.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Standard Notice CSV Header) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(```csv) Tj
T*
(vendor_name,vendor_purpose,change_type,processing_region,data_categories,customer_segment,notice_date,effective_date,objection_window_days,objection_deadline,notice_status,owner,evidence_url,review_notes) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Status Values) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- draft: facts are still being gathered.) Tj
T*
(- review: waiting for product, security, privacy, or counsel review.) Tj
T*
(- approved: ready to send.) Tj
T*
(- sent: notice has been sent.) Tj
T*
(- objection_open: objection period is active.) Tj
T*
(- blocked: missing facts, review, approval, or customer routing.) Tj
T*
(- closed: objection window closed and evidence is archived.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Date Checks) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Before sending a notice, confirm:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- notice_date is the date the customer notice will be sent.) Tj
T*
(- effective_date is not earlier than the notice deadline unless counsel approves the approach.) Tj
T*
(- objection_deadline equals notice_date plus objection_window_days.) Tj
T*
(- Every sent row has an evidence link or internal archive reference.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Spreadsheet Import Steps) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Import the CSV into a new spreadsheet.) Tj
T*
(2. Set date columns to plain date format.) Tj
T*
(3. Freeze the header row.) Tj
T*
(4. Protect the header row if your spreadsheet tool supports it.) Tj
T*
(5. Filter by notice_status, owner, and objection_deadline.) Tj
T*
(6. Export a backup CSV after each material workflow update.) Tj
ET
